From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 14:33:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] (halium) Implement Java module disabling via halium_ignored

Add haliumIgnored() helper to skip dependency errors for ignored modules.
Silently drop missing dependencies for modules matching halium_ignored_modules.list patterns.
Allows build to proceed without Java modules while gracefully handling their deps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I8cb8e600d02e8f260e54a8f588d1b126eb1cb564
